{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8nroAdLSQ8ncQiRhHW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01W5CnZ7JUSoPfMUnnxkvmAU","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\n","new_string":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7642,"cache_read_input_tokens":37657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7642},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"253e8c81-48df-4aa4-b5a8-20bfdef547cf","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:47.863Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8nrY2nk49dsHd21FfR","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01W5CnZ7JUSoPfMUnnxkvmAU":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\n","new_string":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font\n"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W5CnZ7JUSoPfMUnnxkvmAU","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"d25744b9-fce5-478c-b064-a4c24e2e8b0d","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:47.871Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","oldString":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\n","newString":"from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font\n","originalFile":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"从精准读取、批量合并、透视汇总到格式美化与条件格式，5 个实用技巧让 Python 帮你搞定 Excel 报表。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n  <article>\n    <header>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Python · 数据处理</span>\n      <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n        <span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>\n        <span>pandas · openpyxl</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <p class=\"lede\">每周一早上打开十几个 Excel 文件，复制、粘贴、透视、调格式……这些重复劳动完全可以交给 Python。本文整理了 5 个我在日常报表工作中最常用的技巧，每个都附带可以直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n    <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n      <strong>目录</strong>\n      <ol>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip1\">精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip2\">批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip3\">透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip4\">多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip5\">条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</a></li>\n      </ol>\n    </nav>\n\n    <h3>准备工作</h3>\n    <p>本文用到的两个库：<code>pandas</code> 负责数据处理，<code>openpyxl</code> 负责读写 <code>.xlsx</code> 以及样式控制。假设我们有一份销售明细，字段包括：<code>日期</code>、<code>区域</code>、<code>产品</code>、<code>销售员</code>、<code>数量</code>、<code>单价</code>。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>bash</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code class=\"plain\">pip install pandas openpyxl</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 1 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</h2>\n    <p>很多人习惯直接 <code>pd.read_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code>，结果读进来一堆无用的列、标题行和备注行，还要再花时间清理。其实 <code>read_excel</code> 提供了不少参数，可以在读取阶段就把数据“裁剪”干净：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>import pandas as pd\n\ndf = pd.read_excel(\n    \"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\",\n    sheet_name=\"明细\",            # 指定 Sheet，也可以传索引 0\n    skiprows=2,                   # 跳过顶部的大标题和说明行\n    usecols=\"A:F\",                # 只读 A 到 F 列，也可以传列名列表\n    dtype={\"销售员\": str},         # 防止工号类字段被识别成数字丢掉前导 0\n    parse_dates=[\"日期\"],          # 直接解析为日期类型\n    nrows=10_000,                 # 调试时只读前 N 行，速度飞快\n)\n\nprint(df.dtypes)\nprint(df.head())</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果一个工作簿里有多个结构相同的 Sheet（例如按月份分 Sheet），传入 <code>sheet_name=None</code> 可以一次读出全部，返回的是一个 <code>{Sheet 名: DataFrame}</code> 的字典：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>sheets = pd.read_excel(\"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\", sheet_name=None)\n\n# 把每个 Sheet 的名字记成一列，再纵向拼接\ndf_all = pd.concat(\n    [d.assign(月份=name) for name, d in sheets.items()],\n    ignore_index=True,\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>Excel 里看起来是“001”的编号，读进来常常变成 <code>1</code>。用 <code>dtype</code> 把这类列强制指定为 <code>str</code>，比事后用 <code>zfill</code> 补零可靠得多。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 2 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</h2>\n    <p>各区域每周交上来一个 Excel，文件名各不相同、偶尔还夹杂着临时文件。用 <code>pathlib</code> 遍历目录，再配合 <code>pd.concat</code>，几行代码就能把几十个文件合成一张总表：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfolder = Path(\"reports/2026-W43\")\nframes = []\n\nfor path in sorted(folder.glob(\"*.xlsx\")):\n    if path.name.startswith(\"~$\"):     # 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时锁文件\n        continue\n    try:\n        df = pd.read_excel(path, usecols=\"A:F\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"⚠️ 读取失败：{path.name} -&gt; {e}\")\n        continue\n    df[\"来源文件\"] = path.stem          # 记录数据来源，方便回溯\n    frames.append(df)\n\nmerged = pd.concat(frames, ignore_index=True)\nprint(f\"共合并 {len(frames)} 个文件，{len(merged):,} 行数据\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>合并之后，顺手做一次基础清洗，后面的统计会省心很多：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>merged = (\n    merged\n    .dropna(subset=[\"产品\", \"数量\"])                 # 去掉关键字段为空的行\n    .drop_duplicates()                               # 去掉完全重复的行\n    .assign(\n        区域=lambda d: d[\"区域\"].str.strip(),         # 去掉首尾空格，避免“华东 ”和“华东”被当成两类\n        销售额=lambda d: d[\"数量\"] * d[\"单价\"],\n    )\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>不要在循环里反复 <code>pd.concat</code> 或 <code>df.append</code>，那样每次都会复制整张表。先把 DataFrame 放进列表，最后统一拼接一次，速度快一个数量级。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 3 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</h2>\n    <p>Excel 透视表很好用，但每次数据更新都要重新拖拽字段。<code>pivot_table</code> 能把同样的逻辑写成代码，下次只需重新运行：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>pivot = pd.pivot_table(\n    merged,\n    index=\"区域\",                     # 行\n    columns=\"产品\",                   # 列\n    values=\"销售额\",                  # 统计的值\n    aggfunc=\"sum\",\n    fill_value=0,                     # 没有数据的格子填 0 而不是 NaN\n    margins=True,                     # 添加“合计”行和列\n    margins_name=\"合计\",\n).round(2)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果需要同时看多个指标，用 <code>groupby</code> + 命名聚合会更清晰，输出的列名也直接就是报表要用的中文名：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>summary = (\n    merged\n    .groupby(\"销售员\", as_index=False)\n    .agg(\n        订单数=(\"产品\", \"count\"),\n        总销量=(\"数量\", \"sum\"),\n        总销售额=(\"销售额\", \"sum\"),\n        客单价=(\"销售额\", \"mean\"),\n    )\n    .sort_values(\"总销售额\", ascending=False)\n)\n\n# 计算占比，并按月汇总趋势\nsummary[\"销售额占比\"] = summary[\"总销售额\"] / summary[\"总销售额\"].sum()\nmonthly = merged.resample(\"MS\", on=\"日期\")[\"销售额\"].sum()</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>需求</th><th>推荐写法</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>二维交叉表（行 × 列）</td><td><code>pd.pivot_table</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>一个维度、多个指标</td><td><code>groupby().agg(命名聚合)</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>按日 / 周 / 月汇总</td><td><code>resample(\"D\" / \"W\" / \"MS\")</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>只要计数</td><td><code>value_counts()</code> 或 <code>pd.crosstab</code></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 4 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</h2>\n    <p><code>df.to_excel()</code> 输出的表格往往列宽挤成一团、数字没有千分位、表头也没有样式。用 <code>ExcelWriter</code> 可以把多张结果写进同一个文件，再借助 openpyxl 统一美化：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\nHEADER_FILL = PatternFill(\"solid\", fgColor=\"1D7A4F\")\nHEADER_FONT = Font(bold=True, color=\"FFFFFF\")\nTHIN = Side(style=\"thin\", color=\"D0D0D0\")\n\ndef beautify(ws, money_cols=(), pct_cols=()):\n    \"\"\"统一设置表头、列宽、数字格式、冻结窗格和筛选。\"\"\"\n    # 1. 表头样式\n    for cell in ws[1]:\n        cell.fill = HEADER_FILL\n        cell.font = HEADER_FONT\n        cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=\"center\", vertical=\"center\")\n\n    # 2. 按内容自动调整列宽（中文字符按 2 个宽度计算）\n    for col in ws.columns:\n        width = max(\n            sum(2 if ord(ch) &gt; 127 else 1 for ch in str(c.value or \"\"))\n            for c in col\n        )\n        ws.column_dimensions[get_column_letter(col[0].column)].width = min(width + 4, 40)\n\n    # 3. 数字格式与边框\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2):\n        for cell in row:\n            cell.border = Border(top=THIN, bottom=THIN, left=THIN, right=THIN)\n            if cell.column_letter in money_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"#,##0.00\"\n            elif cell.column_letter in pct_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"0.0%\"\n\n    ws.freeze_panes = \"A2\"              # 冻结表头\n    ws.auto_filter.ref = ws.dimensions  # 开启筛选\n\nwith pd.ExcelWriter(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\", engine=\"openpyxl\") as writer:\n    merged.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"明细\", index=False)\n    pivot.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"区域×产品\")\n    summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"销售员排名\", index=False)\n\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"明细\"], money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"区域×产品\"])\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"销售员排名\"], money_cols=(\"D\", \"E\"), pct_cols=(\"F\",))</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>如果是在已有的报表模板里追加新 Sheet，用 <code>pd.ExcelWriter(path, mode=\"a\", if_sheet_exists=\"replace\")</code>，就不会覆盖模板里的其它内容。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 5 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</h2>\n    <p>领导打开报表的第一眼，最关心的是“哪里好、哪里不好”。与其手动标红，不如直接在生成时加上条件格式和图表。这些都是 Excel 原生功能，数据变化时会自动更新：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl import load_workbook\nfrom openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule, DataBarRule, CellIsRule\nfrom openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\n\nwb = load_workbook(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")\nws = wb[\"销售员排名\"]\nlast = ws.max_row\n\n# 1. 数据条：总销售额一眼看出高低\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"D2:D{last}\",\n    DataBarRule(start_type=\"min\", end_type=\"max\", color=\"4CC38A\"),\n)\n\n# 2. 三色阶：客单价从红到绿\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"E2:E{last}\",\n    ColorScaleRule(start_type=\"min\", start_color=\"F8696B\",\n                   mid_type=\"percentile\", mid_value=50, mid_color=\"FFEB84\",\n                   end_type=\"max\", end_color=\"63BE7B\"),\n)\n\n# 3. 规则高亮：销售额占比低于 5% 的标红\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"F2:F{last}\",\n    CellIsRule(operator=\"lessThan\", formula=[\"0.05\"],\n               font=Font(color=\"C00000\", bold=True)),\n)\n\n# 4. 插入柱状图：销售额 Top 10\nchart = BarChart()\nchart.title = \"销售员销售额 Top 10\"\nchart.y_axis.title = \"销售额（元）\"\nchart.height, chart.width = 8, 16\n\ntop_n = min(last, 11)\ndata = Reference(ws, min_col=4, min_row=1, max_row=top_n)   # 包含表头作为系列名\ncats = Reference(ws, min_col=1, min_row=2, max_row=top_n)\nchart.add_data(data, titles_from_data=True)\nchart.set_categories(cats)\n\nws.add_chart(chart, \"H2\")\nwb.save(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>最后，把技巧 2～5 串成一个脚本，再交给系统的定时任务（macOS / Linux 用 <code>cron</code>，Windows 用“任务计划程序”），每周一早上报表就已经躺在共享盘里了。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>def main(week: str):\n    merged = load_and_merge(f\"reports/{week}\")      # 技巧 1、2\n    pivot, summary = build_summary(merged)          # 技巧 3\n    out = export(merged, pivot, summary, week)      # 技巧 4\n    add_highlights(out)                             # 技巧 5\n    print(f\"✅ 报表已生成：{out}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    main(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) &gt; 1 else \"2026-W43\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"summary\">\n      <h2>总结</h2>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>精准读取</strong>：善用 <code>sheet_name</code>、<code>usecols</code>、<code>skiprows</code>、<code>dtype</code>，在源头把数据裁干净。</li>\n        <li><strong>批量合并</strong>：<code>pathlib.glob</code> + 列表收集 + 一次性 <code>concat</code>，并记录来源文件。</li>\n        <li><strong>透视汇总</strong>：<code>pivot_table</code> 做交叉表，<code>groupby().agg()</code> 做多指标统计。</li>\n        <li><strong>格式美化</strong>：<code>ExcelWriter</code> 输出多 Sheet，openpyxl 统一表头、列宽、数字格式。</li>\n        <li><strong>条件格式与图表</strong>：数据条、色阶、规则高亮和原生图表，让结论一目了然。</li>\n      </ol>\n      <p>当这些步骤都变成代码，报表就不再是“每周的体力活”，而是一条可复用、可审查、可追溯的数据流水线。</p>\n    </section>\n  </article>\n\n  <footer>\n    本文代码基于 Python 3.12、pandas 2.x、openpyxl 3.1 编写。如有问题欢迎交流。\n  </footer>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var KW = /^(import|from|as|def|return|for|in|if|elif|else|try|except|continue|with|lambda|not|and|or|None|True|False|print|min|max|sum|len|str|ord|sorted)$/;\n  var TOKEN = /(#[^\\n]*)|(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|f?\"[^\"\\n]*\"|f?'[^'\\n]*')|(\\b\\d[\\d_.]*\\b)|([A-Za-z_一-龥][\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|([\\s\\S])/g;\n\n  function esc(s) {\n    return s.replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");\n  }\n\n  function highlight(src) {\n    var out = \"\", m;\n    TOKEN.lastIndex = 0;\n    while ((m = TOKEN.exec(src)) !== null) {\n      if (m[1]) out += '<span class=\"tok-com\">' + esc(m[1]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[2]) out += '<span class=\"tok-str\">' + esc(m[2]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[3]) out += '<span class=\"tok-num\">' + esc(m[3]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[4]) {\n        var isCall = src.slice(TOKEN.lastIndex).match(/^\\s*\\(/);\n        if (KW.test(m[4])) out += '<span class=\"tok-kw\">' + m[4] + \"</span>\";\n        else if (isCall) out += '<span class=\"tok-fn\">' + esc(m[4]) + \"</span>\";\n        else out += esc(m[4]);\n      } else out += esc(m[5]);\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"pre code:not(.plain)\").forEach(function (el) {\n    el.innerHTML = highlight(el.textContent);\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy-btn\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"code\");\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = \"已复制\";\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      var fallback = function () {\n        var range = document.createRange();\n        range.selectNodeContents(code);\n        var sel = window.getSelection();\n        sel.removeAllRanges();\n        sel.addRange(range);\n        btn.textContent = \"已选中，按 Ctrl/⌘+C\";\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent).then(done, fallback);\n      } else {\n        fallback();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":222,"oldLines":6,"newStart":222,"newLines":7,"lines":["       <pre><code>from openpyxl import load_workbook"," from openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule, DataBarRule, CellIsRule"," from openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference","+from openpyxl.styles import Font"," "," wb = load_workbook(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")"," ws = wb[\"销售员排名\"]"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01W5CnZ7JUSoPfMUnnxkvmAU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8nroAdLSQ8ncQiRhHW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LNyqd7WyzePWAc5EhFFGkW","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))","new_string":"money_cols=(\"F\", \"H\"))"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7642,"cache_read_input_tokens":37657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7642},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"a5a13073-7330-4c16-b1b2-1b11b9b12de8","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:49.498Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8nrY2nk49dsHd21FfR","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01LNyqd7WyzePWAc5EhFFGkW":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))","new_string":"money_cols=(\"F\", \"H\"))"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LNyqd7WyzePWAc5EhFFGkW","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"5b15afef-6579-4d6a-bc8b-bcb2227136a1","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:49.504Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","oldString":"money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))","newString":"money_cols=(\"F\", \"H\"))","originalFile":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"从精准读取、批量合并、透视汇总到格式美化与条件格式，5 个实用技巧让 Python 帮你搞定 Excel 报表。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n  <article>\n    <header>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Python · 数据处理</span>\n      <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n        <span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>\n        <span>pandas · openpyxl</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <p class=\"lede\">每周一早上打开十几个 Excel 文件，复制、粘贴、透视、调格式……这些重复劳动完全可以交给 Python。本文整理了 5 个我在日常报表工作中最常用的技巧，每个都附带可以直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n    <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n      <strong>目录</strong>\n      <ol>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip1\">精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip2\">批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip3\">透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip4\">多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip5\">条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</a></li>\n      </ol>\n    </nav>\n\n    <h3>准备工作</h3>\n    <p>本文用到的两个库：<code>pandas</code> 负责数据处理，<code>openpyxl</code> 负责读写 <code>.xlsx</code> 以及样式控制。假设我们有一份销售明细，字段包括：<code>日期</code>、<code>区域</code>、<code>产品</code>、<code>销售员</code>、<code>数量</code>、<code>单价</code>。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>bash</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code class=\"plain\">pip install pandas openpyxl</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 1 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</h2>\n    <p>很多人习惯直接 <code>pd.read_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code>，结果读进来一堆无用的列、标题行和备注行，还要再花时间清理。其实 <code>read_excel</code> 提供了不少参数，可以在读取阶段就把数据“裁剪”干净：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>import pandas as pd\n\ndf = pd.read_excel(\n    \"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\",\n    sheet_name=\"明细\",            # 指定 Sheet，也可以传索引 0\n    skiprows=2,                   # 跳过顶部的大标题和说明行\n    usecols=\"A:F\",                # 只读 A 到 F 列，也可以传列名列表\n    dtype={\"销售员\": str},         # 防止工号类字段被识别成数字丢掉前导 0\n    parse_dates=[\"日期\"],          # 直接解析为日期类型\n    nrows=10_000,                 # 调试时只读前 N 行，速度飞快\n)\n\nprint(df.dtypes)\nprint(df.head())</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果一个工作簿里有多个结构相同的 Sheet（例如按月份分 Sheet），传入 <code>sheet_name=None</code> 可以一次读出全部，返回的是一个 <code>{Sheet 名: DataFrame}</code> 的字典：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>sheets = pd.read_excel(\"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\", sheet_name=None)\n\n# 把每个 Sheet 的名字记成一列，再纵向拼接\ndf_all = pd.concat(\n    [d.assign(月份=name) for name, d in sheets.items()],\n    ignore_index=True,\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>Excel 里看起来是“001”的编号，读进来常常变成 <code>1</code>。用 <code>dtype</code> 把这类列强制指定为 <code>str</code>，比事后用 <code>zfill</code> 补零可靠得多。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 2 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</h2>\n    <p>各区域每周交上来一个 Excel，文件名各不相同、偶尔还夹杂着临时文件。用 <code>pathlib</code> 遍历目录，再配合 <code>pd.concat</code>，几行代码就能把几十个文件合成一张总表：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfolder = Path(\"reports/2026-W43\")\nframes = []\n\nfor path in sorted(folder.glob(\"*.xlsx\")):\n    if path.name.startswith(\"~$\"):     # 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时锁文件\n        continue\n    try:\n        df = pd.read_excel(path, usecols=\"A:F\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"⚠️ 读取失败：{path.name} -&gt; {e}\")\n        continue\n    df[\"来源文件\"] = path.stem          # 记录数据来源，方便回溯\n    frames.append(df)\n\nmerged = pd.concat(frames, ignore_index=True)\nprint(f\"共合并 {len(frames)} 个文件，{len(merged):,} 行数据\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>合并之后，顺手做一次基础清洗，后面的统计会省心很多：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>merged = (\n    merged\n    .dropna(subset=[\"产品\", \"数量\"])                 # 去掉关键字段为空的行\n    .drop_duplicates()                               # 去掉完全重复的行\n    .assign(\n        区域=lambda d: d[\"区域\"].str.strip(),         # 去掉首尾空格，避免“华东 ”和“华东”被当成两类\n        销售额=lambda d: d[\"数量\"] * d[\"单价\"],\n    )\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>不要在循环里反复 <code>pd.concat</code> 或 <code>df.append</code>，那样每次都会复制整张表。先把 DataFrame 放进列表，最后统一拼接一次，速度快一个数量级。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 3 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</h2>\n    <p>Excel 透视表很好用，但每次数据更新都要重新拖拽字段。<code>pivot_table</code> 能把同样的逻辑写成代码，下次只需重新运行：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>pivot = pd.pivot_table(\n    merged,\n    index=\"区域\",                     # 行\n    columns=\"产品\",                   # 列\n    values=\"销售额\",                  # 统计的值\n    aggfunc=\"sum\",\n    fill_value=0,                     # 没有数据的格子填 0 而不是 NaN\n    margins=True,                     # 添加“合计”行和列\n    margins_name=\"合计\",\n).round(2)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果需要同时看多个指标，用 <code>groupby</code> + 命名聚合会更清晰，输出的列名也直接就是报表要用的中文名：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>summary = (\n    merged\n    .groupby(\"销售员\", as_index=False)\n    .agg(\n        订单数=(\"产品\", \"count\"),\n        总销量=(\"数量\", \"sum\"),\n        总销售额=(\"销售额\", \"sum\"),\n        客单价=(\"销售额\", \"mean\"),\n    )\n    .sort_values(\"总销售额\", ascending=False)\n)\n\n# 计算占比，并按月汇总趋势\nsummary[\"销售额占比\"] = summary[\"总销售额\"] / summary[\"总销售额\"].sum()\nmonthly = merged.resample(\"MS\", on=\"日期\")[\"销售额\"].sum()</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>需求</th><th>推荐写法</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>二维交叉表（行 × 列）</td><td><code>pd.pivot_table</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>一个维度、多个指标</td><td><code>groupby().agg(命名聚合)</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>按日 / 周 / 月汇总</td><td><code>resample(\"D\" / \"W\" / \"MS\")</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>只要计数</td><td><code>value_counts()</code> 或 <code>pd.crosstab</code></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 4 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</h2>\n    <p><code>df.to_excel()</code> 输出的表格往往列宽挤成一团、数字没有千分位、表头也没有样式。用 <code>ExcelWriter</code> 可以把多张结果写进同一个文件，再借助 openpyxl 统一美化：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\nHEADER_FILL = PatternFill(\"solid\", fgColor=\"1D7A4F\")\nHEADER_FONT = Font(bold=True, color=\"FFFFFF\")\nTHIN = Side(style=\"thin\", color=\"D0D0D0\")\n\ndef beautify(ws, money_cols=(), pct_cols=()):\n    \"\"\"统一设置表头、列宽、数字格式、冻结窗格和筛选。\"\"\"\n    # 1. 表头样式\n    for cell in ws[1]:\n        cell.fill = HEADER_FILL\n        cell.font = HEADER_FONT\n        cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=\"center\", vertical=\"center\")\n\n    # 2. 按内容自动调整列宽（中文字符按 2 个宽度计算）\n    for col in ws.columns:\n        width = max(\n            sum(2 if ord(ch) &gt; 127 else 1 for ch in str(c.value or \"\"))\n            for c in col\n        )\n        ws.column_dimensions[get_column_letter(col[0].column)].width = min(width + 4, 40)\n\n    # 3. 数字格式与边框\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2):\n        for cell in row:\n            cell.border = Border(top=THIN, bottom=THIN, left=THIN, right=THIN)\n            if cell.column_letter in money_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"#,##0.00\"\n            elif cell.column_letter in pct_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"0.0%\"\n\n    ws.freeze_panes = \"A2\"              # 冻结表头\n    ws.auto_filter.ref = ws.dimensions  # 开启筛选\n\nwith pd.ExcelWriter(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\", engine=\"openpyxl\") as writer:\n    merged.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"明细\", index=False)\n    pivot.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"区域×产品\")\n    summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"销售员排名\", index=False)\n\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"明细\"], money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"区域×产品\"])\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"销售员排名\"], money_cols=(\"D\", \"E\"), pct_cols=(\"F\",))</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>如果是在已有的报表模板里追加新 Sheet，用 <code>pd.ExcelWriter(path, mode=\"a\", if_sheet_exists=\"replace\")</code>，就不会覆盖模板里的其它内容。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 5 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</h2>\n    <p>领导打开报表的第一眼，最关心的是“哪里好、哪里不好”。与其手动标红，不如直接在生成时加上条件格式和图表。这些都是 Excel 原生功能，数据变化时会自动更新：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl import load_workbook\nfrom openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule, DataBarRule, CellIsRule\nfrom openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font\n\nwb = load_workbook(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")\nws = wb[\"销售员排名\"]\nlast = ws.max_row\n\n# 1. 数据条：总销售额一眼看出高低\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"D2:D{last}\",\n    DataBarRule(start_type=\"min\", end_type=\"max\", color=\"4CC38A\"),\n)\n\n# 2. 三色阶：客单价从红到绿\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"E2:E{last}\",\n    ColorScaleRule(start_type=\"min\", start_color=\"F8696B\",\n                   mid_type=\"percentile\", mid_value=50, mid_color=\"FFEB84\",\n                   end_type=\"max\", end_color=\"63BE7B\"),\n)\n\n# 3. 规则高亮：销售额占比低于 5% 的标红\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"F2:F{last}\",\n    CellIsRule(operator=\"lessThan\", formula=[\"0.05\"],\n               font=Font(color=\"C00000\", bold=True)),\n)\n\n# 4. 插入柱状图：销售额 Top 10\nchart = BarChart()\nchart.title = \"销售员销售额 Top 10\"\nchart.y_axis.title = \"销售额（元）\"\nchart.height, chart.width = 8, 16\n\ntop_n = min(last, 11)\ndata = Reference(ws, min_col=4, min_row=1, max_row=top_n)   # 包含表头作为系列名\ncats = Reference(ws, min_col=1, min_row=2, max_row=top_n)\nchart.add_data(data, titles_from_data=True)\nchart.set_categories(cats)\n\nws.add_chart(chart, \"H2\")\nwb.save(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>最后，把技巧 2～5 串成一个脚本，再交给系统的定时任务（macOS / Linux 用 <code>cron</code>，Windows 用“任务计划程序”），每周一早上报表就已经躺在共享盘里了。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>def main(week: str):\n    merged = load_and_merge(f\"reports/{week}\")      # 技巧 1、2\n    pivot, summary = build_summary(merged)          # 技巧 3\n    out = export(merged, pivot, summary, week)      # 技巧 4\n    add_highlights(out)                             # 技巧 5\n    print(f\"✅ 报表已生成：{out}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    main(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) &gt; 1 else \"2026-W43\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"summary\">\n      <h2>总结</h2>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>精准读取</strong>：善用 <code>sheet_name</code>、<code>usecols</code>、<code>skiprows</code>、<code>dtype</code>，在源头把数据裁干净。</li>\n        <li><strong>批量合并</strong>：<code>pathlib.glob</code> + 列表收集 + 一次性 <code>concat</code>，并记录来源文件。</li>\n        <li><strong>透视汇总</strong>：<code>pivot_table</code> 做交叉表，<code>groupby().agg()</code> 做多指标统计。</li>\n        <li><strong>格式美化</strong>：<code>ExcelWriter</code> 输出多 Sheet，openpyxl 统一表头、列宽、数字格式。</li>\n        <li><strong>条件格式与图表</strong>：数据条、色阶、规则高亮和原生图表，让结论一目了然。</li>\n      </ol>\n      <p>当这些步骤都变成代码，报表就不再是“每周的体力活”，而是一条可复用、可审查、可追溯的数据流水线。</p>\n    </section>\n  </article>\n\n  <footer>\n    本文代码基于 Python 3.12、pandas 2.x、openpyxl 3.1 编写。如有问题欢迎交流。\n  </footer>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var KW = /^(import|from|as|def|return|for|in|if|elif|else|try|except|continue|with|lambda|not|and|or|None|True|False|print|min|max|sum|len|str|ord|sorted)$/;\n  var TOKEN = /(#[^\\n]*)|(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|f?\"[^\"\\n]*\"|f?'[^'\\n]*')|(\\b\\d[\\d_.]*\\b)|([A-Za-z_一-龥][\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|([\\s\\S])/g;\n\n  function esc(s) {\n    return s.replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");\n  }\n\n  function highlight(src) {\n    var out = \"\", m;\n    TOKEN.lastIndex = 0;\n    while ((m = TOKEN.exec(src)) !== null) {\n      if (m[1]) out += '<span class=\"tok-com\">' + esc(m[1]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[2]) out += '<span class=\"tok-str\">' + esc(m[2]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[3]) out += '<span class=\"tok-num\">' + esc(m[3]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[4]) {\n        var isCall = src.slice(TOKEN.lastIndex).match(/^\\s*\\(/);\n        if (KW.test(m[4])) out += '<span class=\"tok-kw\">' + m[4] + \"</span>\";\n        else if (isCall) out += '<span class=\"tok-fn\">' + esc(m[4]) + \"</span>\";\n        else out += esc(m[4]);\n      } else out += esc(m[5]);\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"pre code:not(.plain)\").forEach(function (el) {\n    el.innerHTML = highlight(el.textContent);\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy-btn\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"code\");\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = \"已复制\";\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      var fallback = function () {\n        var range = document.createRange();\n        range.selectNodeContents(code);\n        var sel = window.getSelection();\n        sel.removeAllRanges();\n        sel.addRange(range);\n        btn.textContent = \"已选中，按 Ctrl/⌘+C\";\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent).then(done, fallback);\n      } else {\n        fallback();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":208,"oldLines":7,"newStart":208,"newLines":7,"lines":["     pivot.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"区域×产品\")","     summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"销售员排名\", index=False)"," ","-    beautify(writer.sheets[\"明细\"], money_cols=(\"E\", \"F\", \"H\"))","+    beautify(writer.sheets[\"明细\"], money_cols=(\"F\", \"H\"))","     beautify(writer.sheets[\"区域×产品\"])","     beautify(writer.sheets[\"销售员排名\"], money_cols=(\"D\", \"E\"), pct_cols=(\"F\",))</code></pre>","     </div>"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01LNyqd7WyzePWAc5EhFFGkW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgQ8nroAdLSQ8ncQiRhHW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ak8mdcUMv3ZJvLebJmGR25","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"[\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|","new_string":"[\\w一-龥]*)|"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7642,"cache_read_input_tokens":37657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":7642},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"d1f8d433-c6cf-463a-83bf-7504f85f6264","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:51.093Z","request_id":"req_011CgQ8nrY2nk49dsHd21FfR","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01Ak8mdcUMv3ZJvLebJmGR25":{"file_path":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","old_string":"[\\w\\u4e00-\\u9fa5]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|","new_string":"[\\w\\u4e00-\\u9fa5]*)|"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ak8mdcUMv3ZJvLebJmGR25","type":"tool_result","content":"The file <tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3209c55d-c5a1-4614-998b-2ead9145c815","uuid":"0e2b1063-3c1b-4fbf-9714-23cac531f221","timestamp":"2026-10-26T03:25:51.100Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"<tmp>/measure-baseline-claude-code-007-aUdnoe/index.html","oldString":"[\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|","newString":"[\\w一-龥]*)|","originalFile":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<title>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"从精准读取、批量合并、透视汇总到格式美化与条件格式，5 个实用技巧让 Python 帮你搞定 Excel 报表。\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"wrap\">\n  <article>\n    <header>\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Python · 数据处理</span>\n      <h1>用 Python 处理 Excel 报表的 5 个技巧</h1>\n      <div class=\"meta\">\n        <span>2026 年 10 月 26 日</span>\n        <span>阅读约 10 分钟</span>\n        <span>pandas · openpyxl</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <p class=\"lede\">每周一早上打开十几个 Excel 文件，复制、粘贴、透视、调格式……这些重复劳动完全可以交给 Python。本文整理了 5 个我在日常报表工作中最常用的技巧，每个都附带可以直接运行的代码。</p>\n\n    <nav class=\"toc\" aria-label=\"目录\">\n      <strong>目录</strong>\n      <ol>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip1\">精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip2\">批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip3\">透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip4\">多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#tip5\">条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</a></li>\n      </ol>\n    </nav>\n\n    <h3>准备工作</h3>\n    <p>本文用到的两个库：<code>pandas</code> 负责数据处理，<code>openpyxl</code> 负责读写 <code>.xlsx</code> 以及样式控制。假设我们有一份销售明细，字段包括：<code>日期</code>、<code>区域</code>、<code>产品</code>、<code>销售员</code>、<code>数量</code>、<code>单价</code>。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>bash</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code class=\"plain\">pip install pandas openpyxl</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 1 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip1\"><span class=\"num\">01</span>精准读取：只读需要的 Sheet、列和行</h2>\n    <p>很多人习惯直接 <code>pd.read_excel(\"报表.xlsx\")</code>，结果读进来一堆无用的列、标题行和备注行，还要再花时间清理。其实 <code>read_excel</code> 提供了不少参数，可以在读取阶段就把数据“裁剪”干净：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>import pandas as pd\n\ndf = pd.read_excel(\n    \"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\",\n    sheet_name=\"明细\",            # 指定 Sheet，也可以传索引 0\n    skiprows=2,                   # 跳过顶部的大标题和说明行\n    usecols=\"A:F\",                # 只读 A 到 F 列，也可以传列名列表\n    dtype={\"销售员\": str},         # 防止工号类字段被识别成数字丢掉前导 0\n    parse_dates=[\"日期\"],          # 直接解析为日期类型\n    nrows=10_000,                 # 调试时只读前 N 行，速度飞快\n)\n\nprint(df.dtypes)\nprint(df.head())</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果一个工作簿里有多个结构相同的 Sheet（例如按月份分 Sheet），传入 <code>sheet_name=None</code> 可以一次读出全部，返回的是一个 <code>{Sheet 名: DataFrame}</code> 的字典：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>sheets = pd.read_excel(\"sales_2026Q3.xlsx\", sheet_name=None)\n\n# 把每个 Sheet 的名字记成一列，再纵向拼接\ndf_all = pd.concat(\n    [d.assign(月份=name) for name, d in sheets.items()],\n    ignore_index=True,\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>Excel 里看起来是“001”的编号，读进来常常变成 <code>1</code>。用 <code>dtype</code> 把这类列强制指定为 <code>str</code>，比事后用 <code>zfill</code> 补零可靠得多。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 2 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip2\"><span class=\"num\">02</span>批量合并：一次性汇总整个文件夹</h2>\n    <p>各区域每周交上来一个 Excel，文件名各不相同、偶尔还夹杂着临时文件。用 <code>pathlib</code> 遍历目录，再配合 <code>pd.concat</code>，几行代码就能把几十个文件合成一张总表：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from pathlib import Path\nimport pandas as pd\n\nfolder = Path(\"reports/2026-W43\")\nframes = []\n\nfor path in sorted(folder.glob(\"*.xlsx\")):\n    if path.name.startswith(\"~$\"):     # 跳过 Excel 打开时生成的临时锁文件\n        continue\n    try:\n        df = pd.read_excel(path, usecols=\"A:F\")\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"⚠️ 读取失败：{path.name} -&gt; {e}\")\n        continue\n    df[\"来源文件\"] = path.stem          # 记录数据来源，方便回溯\n    frames.append(df)\n\nmerged = pd.concat(frames, ignore_index=True)\nprint(f\"共合并 {len(frames)} 个文件，{len(merged):,} 行数据\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>合并之后，顺手做一次基础清洗，后面的统计会省心很多：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>merged = (\n    merged\n    .dropna(subset=[\"产品\", \"数量\"])                 # 去掉关键字段为空的行\n    .drop_duplicates()                               # 去掉完全重复的行\n    .assign(\n        区域=lambda d: d[\"区域\"].str.strip(),         # 去掉首尾空格，避免“华东 ”和“华东”被当成两类\n        销售额=lambda d: d[\"数量\"] * d[\"单价\"],\n    )\n)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>不要在循环里反复 <code>pd.concat</code> 或 <code>df.append</code>，那样每次都会复制整张表。先把 DataFrame 放进列表，最后统一拼接一次，速度快一个数量级。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 3 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip3\"><span class=\"num\">03</span>透视汇总：用 pivot_table 代替手工透视表</h2>\n    <p>Excel 透视表很好用，但每次数据更新都要重新拖拽字段。<code>pivot_table</code> 能把同样的逻辑写成代码，下次只需重新运行：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>pivot = pd.pivot_table(\n    merged,\n    index=\"区域\",                     # 行\n    columns=\"产品\",                   # 列\n    values=\"销售额\",                  # 统计的值\n    aggfunc=\"sum\",\n    fill_value=0,                     # 没有数据的格子填 0 而不是 NaN\n    margins=True,                     # 添加“合计”行和列\n    margins_name=\"合计\",\n).round(2)</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>如果需要同时看多个指标，用 <code>groupby</code> + 命名聚合会更清晰，输出的列名也直接就是报表要用的中文名：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>summary = (\n    merged\n    .groupby(\"销售员\", as_index=False)\n    .agg(\n        订单数=(\"产品\", \"count\"),\n        总销量=(\"数量\", \"sum\"),\n        总销售额=(\"销售额\", \"sum\"),\n        客单价=(\"销售额\", \"mean\"),\n    )\n    .sort_values(\"总销售额\", ascending=False)\n)\n\n# 计算占比，并按月汇总趋势\nsummary[\"销售额占比\"] = summary[\"总销售额\"] / summary[\"总销售额\"].sum()\nmonthly = merged.resample(\"MS\", on=\"日期\")[\"销售额\"].sum()</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-wrap\">\n      <table>\n        <thead>\n          <tr><th>需求</th><th>推荐写法</th></tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr><td>二维交叉表（行 × 列）</td><td><code>pd.pivot_table</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>一个维度、多个指标</td><td><code>groupby().agg(命名聚合)</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>按日 / 周 / 月汇总</td><td><code>resample(\"D\" / \"W\" / \"MS\")</code></td></tr>\n          <tr><td>只要计数</td><td><code>value_counts()</code> 或 <code>pd.crosstab</code></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 4 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip4\"><span class=\"num\">04</span>多 Sheet 输出与格式美化</h2>\n    <p><code>df.to_excel()</code> 输出的表格往往列宽挤成一团、数字没有千分位、表头也没有样式。用 <code>ExcelWriter</code> 可以把多张结果写进同一个文件，再借助 openpyxl 统一美化：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl.styles import Font, PatternFill, Alignment, Border, Side\nfrom openpyxl.utils import get_column_letter\n\nHEADER_FILL = PatternFill(\"solid\", fgColor=\"1D7A4F\")\nHEADER_FONT = Font(bold=True, color=\"FFFFFF\")\nTHIN = Side(style=\"thin\", color=\"D0D0D0\")\n\ndef beautify(ws, money_cols=(), pct_cols=()):\n    \"\"\"统一设置表头、列宽、数字格式、冻结窗格和筛选。\"\"\"\n    # 1. 表头样式\n    for cell in ws[1]:\n        cell.fill = HEADER_FILL\n        cell.font = HEADER_FONT\n        cell.alignment = Alignment(horizontal=\"center\", vertical=\"center\")\n\n    # 2. 按内容自动调整列宽（中文字符按 2 个宽度计算）\n    for col in ws.columns:\n        width = max(\n            sum(2 if ord(ch) &gt; 127 else 1 for ch in str(c.value or \"\"))\n            for c in col\n        )\n        ws.column_dimensions[get_column_letter(col[0].column)].width = min(width + 4, 40)\n\n    # 3. 数字格式与边框\n    for row in ws.iter_rows(min_row=2):\n        for cell in row:\n            cell.border = Border(top=THIN, bottom=THIN, left=THIN, right=THIN)\n            if cell.column_letter in money_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"#,##0.00\"\n            elif cell.column_letter in pct_cols:\n                cell.number_format = \"0.0%\"\n\n    ws.freeze_panes = \"A2\"              # 冻结表头\n    ws.auto_filter.ref = ws.dimensions  # 开启筛选\n\nwith pd.ExcelWriter(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\", engine=\"openpyxl\") as writer:\n    merged.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"明细\", index=False)\n    pivot.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"区域×产品\")\n    summary.to_excel(writer, sheet_name=\"销售员排名\", index=False)\n\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"明细\"], money_cols=(\"F\", \"H\"))\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"区域×产品\"])\n    beautify(writer.sheets[\"销售员排名\"], money_cols=(\"D\", \"E\"), pct_cols=(\"F\",))</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip\"><strong>💡 小提示</strong>如果是在已有的报表模板里追加新 Sheet，用 <code>pd.ExcelWriter(path, mode=\"a\", if_sheet_exists=\"replace\")</code>，就不会覆盖模板里的其它内容。</div>\n\n    <!-- Tip 5 -->\n    <h2 id=\"tip5\"><span class=\"num\">05</span>条件格式与图表：让报表自己“说话”</h2>\n    <p>领导打开报表的第一眼，最关心的是“哪里好、哪里不好”。与其手动标红，不如直接在生成时加上条件格式和图表。这些都是 Excel 原生功能，数据变化时会自动更新：</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>from openpyxl import load_workbook\nfrom openpyxl.formatting.rule import ColorScaleRule, DataBarRule, CellIsRule\nfrom openpyxl.chart import BarChart, Reference\nfrom openpyxl.styles import Font\n\nwb = load_workbook(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")\nws = wb[\"销售员排名\"]\nlast = ws.max_row\n\n# 1. 数据条：总销售额一眼看出高低\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"D2:D{last}\",\n    DataBarRule(start_type=\"min\", end_type=\"max\", color=\"4CC38A\"),\n)\n\n# 2. 三色阶：客单价从红到绿\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"E2:E{last}\",\n    ColorScaleRule(start_type=\"min\", start_color=\"F8696B\",\n                   mid_type=\"percentile\", mid_value=50, mid_color=\"FFEB84\",\n                   end_type=\"max\", end_color=\"63BE7B\"),\n)\n\n# 3. 规则高亮：销售额占比低于 5% 的标红\nws.conditional_formatting.add(\n    f\"F2:F{last}\",\n    CellIsRule(operator=\"lessThan\", formula=[\"0.05\"],\n               font=Font(color=\"C00000\", bold=True)),\n)\n\n# 4. 插入柱状图：销售额 Top 10\nchart = BarChart()\nchart.title = \"销售员销售额 Top 10\"\nchart.y_axis.title = \"销售额（元）\"\nchart.height, chart.width = 8, 16\n\ntop_n = min(last, 11)\ndata = Reference(ws, min_col=4, min_row=1, max_row=top_n)   # 包含表头作为系列名\ncats = Reference(ws, min_col=1, min_row=2, max_row=top_n)\nchart.add_data(data, titles_from_data=True)\nchart.set_categories(cats)\n\nws.add_chart(chart, \"H2\")\nwb.save(\"周报_2026-W43.xlsx\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n    <p>最后，把技巧 2～5 串成一个脚本，再交给系统的定时任务（macOS / Linux 用 <code>cron</code>，Windows 用“任务计划程序”），每周一早上报表就已经躺在共享盘里了。</p>\n    <div class=\"code\">\n      <div class=\"code-head\"><span>python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div>\n      <pre><code>def main(week: str):\n    merged = load_and_merge(f\"reports/{week}\")      # 技巧 1、2\n    pivot, summary = build_summary(merged)          # 技巧 3\n    out = export(merged, pivot, summary, week)      # 技巧 4\n    add_highlights(out)                             # 技巧 5\n    print(f\"✅ 报表已生成：{out}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import sys\n    main(sys.argv[1] if len(sys.argv) &gt; 1 else \"2026-W43\")</code></pre>\n    </div>\n\n    <section class=\"summary\">\n      <h2>总结</h2>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>精准读取</strong>：善用 <code>sheet_name</code>、<code>usecols</code>、<code>skiprows</code>、<code>dtype</code>，在源头把数据裁干净。</li>\n        <li><strong>批量合并</strong>：<code>pathlib.glob</code> + 列表收集 + 一次性 <code>concat</code>，并记录来源文件。</li>\n        <li><strong>透视汇总</strong>：<code>pivot_table</code> 做交叉表，<code>groupby().agg()</code> 做多指标统计。</li>\n        <li><strong>格式美化</strong>：<code>ExcelWriter</code> 输出多 Sheet，openpyxl 统一表头、列宽、数字格式。</li>\n        <li><strong>条件格式与图表</strong>：数据条、色阶、规则高亮和原生图表，让结论一目了然。</li>\n      </ol>\n      <p>当这些步骤都变成代码，报表就不再是“每周的体力活”，而是一条可复用、可审查、可追溯的数据流水线。</p>\n    </section>\n  </article>\n\n  <footer>\n    本文代码基于 Python 3.12、pandas 2.x、openpyxl 3.1 编写。如有问题欢迎交流。\n  </footer>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var KW = /^(import|from|as|def|return|for|in|if|elif|else|try|except|continue|with|lambda|not|and|or|None|True|False|print|min|max|sum|len|str|ord|sorted)$/;\n  var TOKEN = /(#[^\\n]*)|(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|f?\"[^\"\\n]*\"|f?'[^'\\n]*')|(\\b\\d[\\d_.]*\\b)|([A-Za-z_一-龥][\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|([\\s\\S])/g;\n\n  function esc(s) {\n    return s.replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");\n  }\n\n  function highlight(src) {\n    var out = \"\", m;\n    TOKEN.lastIndex = 0;\n    while ((m = TOKEN.exec(src)) !== null) {\n      if (m[1]) out += '<span class=\"tok-com\">' + esc(m[1]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[2]) out += '<span class=\"tok-str\">' + esc(m[2]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[3]) out += '<span class=\"tok-num\">' + esc(m[3]) + \"</span>\";\n      else if (m[4]) {\n        var isCall = src.slice(TOKEN.lastIndex).match(/^\\s*\\(/);\n        if (KW.test(m[4])) out += '<span class=\"tok-kw\">' + m[4] + \"</span>\";\n        else if (isCall) out += '<span class=\"tok-fn\">' + esc(m[4]) + \"</span>\";\n        else out += esc(m[4]);\n      } else out += esc(m[5]);\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\"pre code:not(.plain)\").forEach(function (el) {\n    el.innerHTML = highlight(el.textContent);\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll(\".copy-btn\").forEach(function (btn) {\n    btn.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      var code = btn.closest(\".code\").querySelector(\"code\");\n      var done = function () {\n        btn.textContent = \"已复制\";\n        setTimeout(function () { btn.textContent = \"复制\"; }, 1500);\n      };\n      var fallback = function () {\n        var range = document.createRange();\n        range.selectNodeContents(code);\n        var sel = window.getSelection();\n        sel.removeAllRanges();\n        sel.addRange(range);\n        btn.textContent = \"已选中，按 Ctrl/⌘+C\";\n      };\n      if (navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText) {\n        navigator.clipboard.writeText(code.textContent).then(done, fallback);\n      } else {\n        fallback();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":300,"oldLines":7,"newStart":300,"newLines":7,"lines":[" <script>"," (function () {","   var KW = /^(import|from|as|def|return|for|in|if|elif|else|try|except|continue|with|lambda|not|and|or|None|True|False|print|min|max|sum|len|str|ord|sorted)$/;","-  var TOKEN = /(#[^\\n]*)|(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|f?\"[^\"\\n]*\"|f?'[^'\\n]*')|(\\b\\d[\\d_.]*\\b)|([A-Za-z_一-龥][\\w一-龥]*)(?=\\s*\\()?|([\\s\\S])/g;","+  var TOKEN = /(#[^\\n]*)|(\"\"\"[\\s\\S]*?\"\"\"|f?\"[^\"\\n]*\"|f?'[^'\\n]*')|(\\b\\d[\\d_.]*\\b)|([A-Za-z_一-龥][\\w一-龥]*)|([\\s\\S])/g;"," ","   function esc(s) {","     return s.replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\").replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\");"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Ak8mdcUMv3ZJvLebJmGR25","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
